{"baseRefOid":"23fce23829c6694c3e077a61a20a9038b87f0759","body":"## Summary\n\nClose the fifth audit round's virtual owner/target, dependency and painted-geometry gaps.\n\n- Retain transparent component chains via committed invocation ownership, including state/effects/timers/signals/refs.\n- Bind exact store paths and delayed virtual callbacks to executable owners, without weakening generation/incarnation/activation checks.\n- Traverse nested realized collections and primitive Node/Nodes slots; synchronize containing snapshots and native retained links; discard child requests superseded by a parent prune.\n- Put continuation viewport hitboxes beneath content so internal occluding rejecting children block auto-scroll.\n- Anchor PanZoom to the actual Canvas drawable and make affine inversion relative to scale.\n- Preserve the original round-five audit/probes/logs and add separate remediation evidence. Update USER_GUIDE, ADR 0022 and the pending 0.1.8 release note.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Workspace: 615 tests; all-feature core: 479; default-feature core: 449.\n- Native product tests: 141, including seven promoted drag/selection regressions.\n- Historical independent probes: 89 GPUI + 11 async; 12,870 schema cases; CPU Canvas recorder.\n- Original round-five collections/store/wrapper/nested cases, 3 drag + 4 transform + 4 current-checkout async/default probes, and both actual PanZoom paint anchors pass.\n- Strict workspace/native Clippy, fmt, rustdoc, performance structure tests, target manifest and visual baseline file audit pass.\n- Core/registry package verification, CLI package with the existing no-verify/local-patch boundary, complete macOS release smoke and release artifact audit pass.\n\nProduct correction commit: `01489c31777f`.\nDetailed scope/results: `docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/remediation.zh-CN.md`.\n\nThis PR does not publish 0.1.8, create a tag, or claim independent acceptance. PRs #100/#101 remain unmerged pending native embedded-window ownership / RTL handle fixes; this PR does not silently include their incomplete implementations. Raw audit evidence is preserved byte-for-byte (including log whitespace); product edits pass diff checks.\n","files":[{"path":"USER_GUIDE.md","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/context.rs","additions":71,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/engine.rs","additions":37,"deletions":27,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/geometry.rs","additions":43,"deletions":6,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/lifecycle.rs","additions":290,"deletions":60,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/node.rs","additions":54,"deletions":10,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/pan_zoom.rs","additions":26,"deletions":20,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/renderer.rs","additions":26,"deletions":17,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"crates/gpui-rhai/src/virtual_list_element.rs","additions":4,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/adr/0022-interaction-runtime.md","additions":11,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/SHA256SUMS","additions":70,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/baseline/r1-core.log","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/baseline/r1-drag.log","additions":23,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/baseline/r1-resize.log","additions":29,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/baseline/r1-transforms.log","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-interaction-0.1.8-round5/baseline/r2-async.log","additions":40,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"docs/audits/2026-10-02-int